# **Saturplay!**

-   Bring family and friends to The Lane this Saturday for A community drumming event from 2pm.
-   Drums are provided or bring your own
-   Outdoors, food, cakes and chai
-   All instruments encouraged to join us
-   Its FREE
-   It's FUN
-   It's a beautiful space and you can even do your grocery shopping @ The Pantry.
-   Support local people, local music and community vibes

# **New classes in West African drumming**

-   **Bring a friend** next week and come and join us @ The Palmwoods Memorial Hall for a **5 week African drumming course** for beginners and experienced drummers. 
-   All absolute beginners are welcome and with the weather warming up you will love the drumming vibe. **Meet us and other awesome people** every Tuesday night where the **drumming beats can be heard on the outskirts of Palmwoods**! Just ask the locals! 
-   The courses can be booked via [this link](/product/5-drumming-classes-sunshine-coast/). The cost is $99 for **5 weeks** and drum hire can be paid weekly $4.
-   Beginners 5.30pm & Experienced 7.30pm
-   Get weekly Youtube videos on class material.

# **New classes in West African dance**

-   **Open class** for everyone
-   $15
-   Wear comfortable clothes and bring water
-   **All ages and fitness levels** welcome
-   6.30pm Tuesday nights @ Palmwoods Memorial Hall
-   **Crazy pants and tights are fun**....so please do!
-   Get fit, have fun and join us!
-   **Not your average dance class, come and see why**.
-   **Live drumming!**

